{
    "title": "Fireman for Kids - Fire Truck",
    "description": "Your kid\u2019s dream to become a great HERO and saving lives is here! Become like fireman Sam and use your My Town fire station where your fire trucks are stored to prepare for the missions. A Firefighter game for kids, everyone can enjoy with the firemen.\r\n\r\nFireman for kids is a firefighter simulator game to learn all kinds of fire trucks and engines, fireman suits, fire departments on the fire station, rescue poor baby animals, emergency services and lovely firetruck games.\r\n\r\nFireman for kids is a fun educational game for preschool kids; mainly 3-6 years old boys and girls as well. It is a friendly roleplaying game designed especially for toddlers and little kids .\r\n\r\nLet your child become a firefighter superhero. He will visit our fire station, learn the firefighting equipment and become part of putting out a fire like in real life.This game is for little ones who love fireman and animals as well. \r\n\r\nIn this game:\r\n- The brave firefighter saves the animals in the building where a fire has broken out.\r\n- He will choose his favorite vehicle for different fire fighting adventure situations.\r\n- Your kid will play with his beloved animals, learn to love and save animals, and learn to help others when needed.\r\n- Plenty of encouraging STICKERS and AWARDS await him once he successfully finishes his job.\r\n\r\n                                    \r\nWe, at KiDEO, have always sought to provide the best for your family through applications designed, and directed each age group separately, our belief in the feature each evolutionary stage passes by your son, but in order to lend life skills and the mentality to learn and grow and play correctly and properly, and to communicate with his peers and the environment surrounding it.\r\n\r\nWhat are you waiting for?! let\u2019s download it now and enjoy with \" Fireman for Kids\" \ud83d\ude0e\r\n\r\nVisit us at our Site: https://kideo.tech\r\nFB: https://www.facebook.com/kideo.tech",
    "descriptionHTML": "Your kid\u2019s dream to become a great HERO and saving lives is here! Become like fireman Sam and use your My Town fire station where your fire trucks are stored to prepare for the missions. A Firefighter game for kids, everyone can enjoy with the firemen.<br><br>Fireman for kids is a firefighter simulator game to learn all kinds of fire trucks and engines, fireman suits, fire departments on the fire station, rescue poor baby animals, emergency services and lovely firetruck games.<br><br>Fireman for kids is a fun educational game for preschool kids; mainly 3-6 years old boys and girls as well. It is a friendly roleplaying game designed especially for toddlers and little kids .<br><br>Let your child become a firefighter superhero. He will visit our fire station, learn the firefighting equipment and become part of putting out a fire like in real life.This game is for little ones who love fireman and animals as well. <br><br>In this game:<br>- The brave firefighter saves the animals in the building where a fire has broken out.<br>- He will choose his favorite vehicle for different fire fighting adventure situations.<br>- Your kid will play with his beloved animals, learn to love and save animals, and learn to help others when needed.<br>- Plenty of encouraging STICKERS and AWARDS await him once he successfully finishes his job.<br><br>                                    <br>We, at KiDEO, have always sought to provide the best for your family through applications designed, and directed each age group separately, our belief in the feature each evolutionary stage passes by your son, but in order to lend life skills and the mentality to learn and grow and play correctly and properly, and to communicate with his peers and the environment surrounding it.<br><br>What are you waiting for?! let\u2019s download it now and enjoy with &quot; Fireman for Kids&quot; \ud83d\ude0e<br><br>Visit us at our Site: https://kideo.tech<br>FB: https://www.facebook.com/kideo.tech",
